# Other-repo honesty audit (not ooda, not org std)

File: openOODA/audit/grok_other_repos_2026-08-15.oot
Status: live 2026-08-15. Gemini owns org std/. Muse owns ooda/. This audit is the rest.
Proof bar: emit+gcc+run or a named residual refuse. File count is not product.

## Scope

Audited: docs, openOODA.github.io, .github, qa, vscode, tree-sitter,
helloworld, brand, and the nine boards. Did not edit ooda/ or std/.

## Verdict

The nine boards are mostly still honest. The public org profile is not.
The public website is a splash page that points at a private repo.
QA still runs on 174 leftover `.sh` files. vscode is a Node server, not
a native multi-message `ooda lsp`.

## Per repo

### .github (worst public lie)

HEAD `97cab05` "Standard Library Beta".
`profile/README.md` said: 4,431 std modules, JIT + LLVM release,
0ms GC, and `cargo build --release`.
Truth: product std is 53 tracked files. Cargo is gone. JIT is residual.
Org profile is private so GitHub may not even render it. The text is
still the intended org README.
Also: `README.md`, `profile/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md` (`.md` is
required by GitHub here).

### openOODA.github.io (only public repo)

HEAD `74afb25` (v0.185). Dirty tree deleted `update_*.py` (good) and
grew a README that claims tutorials and API docs (false).
`index.html` title is "Tactical Systems Architecture". CTA is
`github.com/openOODA/openOODA` (private). Nav "Playground" is a lie.
`install.sh` pins `v0.183.0-alpha`, says "trusted seed", has no
checksum. `ooda` is private. Latest GitHub "Latest" tag `v0.184.0-alpha`
has empty assets. Public `curl | sh` cannot work today.
Research papers speak present-tense about moonshots (LSP daemon,
HITL, 0ms GC, bit-identical builds).

### docs

HEAD `a8b4702` "Beta milestone". No `.py`/`.sh`/`.md`. Hub is
`generate_hub.oo`. Getting-started is mostly honest (Backend-C, no JIT)
then lists HashMap / JSON / networking as the std. Performance says
zero GC pauses. Security says unforgeable caps. Papers omit product
reality and read as shipped.

### qa

HEAD `06031af` (v0.185). Dirty: deleted five `.py`, generators exist
as `.oo`. Still 174 `.sh`. `qa_runner.oo` is a tiny builtin check,
not the suite. `qa_phase6_8.sh` still calls deleted `rfc_auditor.py`.
WASM phase treats exit 0 or 2 as PASS. Not a current product proof.

### vscode

HEAD `dbaf70d`. Dirty README grew "full LSP" with definition jump
and references. `server/ooda-lsp.js` actually does initialize,
didOpen/Change, hover (`fn name` + parse ok), documentSymbol, and
`oodac check` diagnostics. That matches SHIPPED: JS server. Native
`ooda lsp` is still initialize/shutdown only.

### tree-sitter

HEAD `bd57ea5`. One leftover `grammar_smoke.sh`. No `src/parser.c`.
`parse_probe.js` is a JS toy. `corpus/valid.oo` still uses residual
`import std::core` / `spec`. Not product ebnf.

### helloworld

HEAD `ce59629`. Dirty: Academy header on `src/main.oo`. Typed lets,
`requires`/`ensures`/`verify`. Looks like a real starter. Not proved
here (would need Muse's tree compiler).

### brand

HEAD `cc97132`. Assets and `DESIGN_SYSTEM.oot`. No product claims
that need a refuse. Dirty README only.

### Boards (openOODA)

HEAD `44b24ee`. No 4431-certified / 16.8s / HITL-product on the nine
boards. Audit header still NOT CERTIFIED.
False leftover: SECURITY op table listed spawn/wait/kill as residual.
SHIPPED residual line lumped product bump arenas with refuse.
Audit body still said Dinner Lint APPROVED / 350 extras untracked.
Junk: `.ooda-cache/`, `*.tmp.c`, `check_board.oo.bin`.

## What I fixed in this pass

Rewrote `.github/profile/README.md`. Corrected SECURITY spawn row,
SHIPPED arena residual, audit stamp block, docs getting-started /
performance / security overclaims, vscode READMEs, website README,
and install "trusted seed" wording. Did not change the install pin
(there is no honest public tarball to point at). Did not delete
174 qa `.sh` files. Did not commit.

## Residual (named, not this pass)

- Public install cannot work while `ooda` is private and assets empty.
- Research papers still speak moonshots in present tense.
- qa e2e leftover `.sh`.
- tree-sitter `grammar_smoke.sh`.
- Website splash still not a language page.
